        "value": "Double-column note: one company is 60 men, but the unit is 20 men short. Five companies at 60 would be 300 men; taking the shortfall as a shortfall of the whole leaves 280. The note does not say whether the 20 are short of the whole or short per company, so the 280 is a reading, not a printed figure."
